  "description": "⭐ <em>Immerse yourself in the full </em><strong><em>SABRAGE</em></strong><em> experience — a seductive, high-octane night of vintage glamour, jaw-dropping circus-theatre, and all-night revelry. From pre-show cocktails to post-show DJ sets, this is London’s most electrifying evening out, hosted at the opulent Lafayette in King’s Cross.&nbsp;The critics are in, the champagne’s popped and the reviews are GLOWING.&nbsp;Now it’s your turn to experience the spectacle. New performers, fresh acts, and unexpected twists keep Sabrage deliciously unpredictable</em><strong><em>&nbsp;🎭</em></strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n✨ 🎟️<strong> CLOSING 7TH SEPTEMBER!</strong> Last chance to see Sabrage, book your tickets today before they're gone.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎪 A dazzling show by Strut &amp; Fret featuring international circus elites and theatrical misfits<br>\r\n🌍 After touring 32 countries, SABRAGE lands in London with cheeky, high-energy entertainment<br>\r\n💃 Vintage glamour, risqué humour, and edge-of-your-seat spectacle<br>\r\n🍸 Arrive early to enjoy handcrafted cocktails and Southern-style bar bites in Lafayette’s buzzing bar and terrace - you can even pre-order to your seats!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: Booking until September 2026<br>\r\n🕒 Select your time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: Approx. 2hr including interval<br>\r\n📍 Location: Lafayette, King’s Cross, 11 Goods Way, London N1C 4DP<br>\r\n⚠️ 18+, contains nudity and adult themes<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: Lafayette is an accessible venue. Please contact&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:sabrage@menierchocolatefactory.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sabrage@menierchocolatefactory.com</a>&nbsp;for all access bookings.<br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for <a href=\"https://www.feverup.com/m/502959\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SABRAGE - A dazzling spectacle at Lafayette London</a> here<br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"http://sabrageshow.com/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n⚠️&nbsp;You'll receive a link in your confirmation email for<strong> pre-ordering food &amp; beverage</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nStep into the world of SABRAGE, where theatrical edge meets decadent Southern charm. Hosted at the luxurious Lafayette in London’s King’s Cross, this unforgettable circus-theatre experience delivers everything from seductive spectacle and razor-sharp humour to world-class acrobatics. Arrive early to enjoy curated cocktails and Southern-style bites! Looking for an extra dash of luxury? SABRAGE isn’t just a show — it’s your next obsession. Don’t miss it!",
